			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Rebuild compiled output after RouteManifest regeneration\n\nRegenerate RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-28T14:34:37Z → 17:51:16Z) and rebuild all Target/ artifacts (JS bundles and source maps) across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, and gRPC layers.\n\nThis is a routine rebuild pass to synchronize compiled output with the regenerated RouteManifest manifest. Mountain method count remains at 142 — no new RPC methods were added in this pass.",
